# tally 2.2.1 P43 S7 (L §5.18's diff row): diff of a kind's entry only the scenario states is added
# (review g2fix dif/d1 with sc/d1). Before W10: changed against refused: RUN-KEY.
=== d1.tally
model d1
  tally 2
  on 2026-01-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
kind persons: parties
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input sx: money PLN
input pay[p in persons]: money PLN
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  persons + [ana] lives 2000-01-01..
  opening[konto] = 500.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  sx = 1.00 PLN "s"
  pay[ana] = 10.00 PLN "s"
ask kk: bal(konto, 2026-03-31), sx law 2026-03-31
=== d1.tally
scenario sc over d1
  tally 2
  from 2026-01-01
place pot: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
input sy: money PLN
version scv
  cite s
  governs 2026-01-01..
  known 2026-01-01
  persons + [ola] lives 2026-01-01..
  replace sx = 2.00 PLN "s"
  sy = 3.00 PLN "s"
  pay[ola] = 20.00 PLN "s"
  opening[pot] = 7.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
ask q_rep: diff(sx) in sc against d1 law 2026-03-31
ask q_in: diff(sy) in sc against d1 law 2026-03-31
ask q_ent: diff(pay[p] for p in persons on 2026-03-01) in sc against d1 law 2026-03-31
ask q_entx: diff(pay[ola]) in sc against d1 law 2026-03-31
ask q_pl: diff(bal(pot, 2026-03-31)) in sc against d1 law 2026-03-31
ask q_mix: diff(sx + sy) in sc against d1 law 2026-03-31
ask q_rev: diff(sy) in d1 against sc law 2026-03-31
ask q_revp: diff(bal(pot, 2026-03-31)) in d1 against sc law 2026-03-31
=== expect q_entx q_ent
q_entx: diff in sc against d1: 0 changed, 1 added, 0 removed, 0 unchanged
  added pay[ola]: 20.00 PLN
  world: d1
  world: sc
  held: pay[ola] = 20.00 PLN (scv), read for 2026-03-31
  law date 2026-03-31, cut 2026-01-01
q_ent: diff in sc against d1: 0 changed, 1 added, 0 removed, 1 unchanged
  added (p = ola): 20.00 PLN
  world: d1
  world: sc
  held: pay[ola] = 20.00 PLN (scv), read for 2026-03-31
  law date 2026-03-31, cut 2026-01-01
warning: WARN-UNREAD place world is read by nothing
